{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "n-gauss",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**介质高斯定理**\n\n$$\\oint_S \\vec{D}\\cdot d\\vec{S} = \\sum q_f$$\n\n$$\\nabla\\cdot\\vec{D} = \\rho_f$$",
			"x": 940,
			"y": 220,
			"width": 290,
			"height": 190
		},
		{
			"id": "n-bc",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**介质边界条件**\n\n$$E_{1\\tau} = E_{2\\tau}$$\n\n$$D_{2n} - D_{1n} = \\sigma_f$$\n\n$$D_{1n} = D_{2n}\\;(\\sigma_f=0)$$\n\n$$\\frac{\\tan\\theta_1}{\\tan\\theta_2} = \\frac{\\varepsilon_{r1}}{\\varepsilon_{r2}}$$",
			"x": 560,
			"y": 585,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 270
		},
		{
			"id": "n-cap",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**电容器中的电介质**\n\n$$C = \\varepsilon_r C_0$$\n\n$$C = \\frac{\\varepsilon S}{d}$$",
			"x": 20,
			"y": 490,
			"width": 290,
			"height": 190
		},
		{
			"id": "n-polar",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**电介质的极化**\n\n$$\\vec{P} = \\frac{\\sum\\vec{p}}{\\Delta V}$$\n\n$$\\sigma_p = \\vec{P}\\cdot\\hat{n}$$\n\n$$\\vec{P} = \\varepsilon_0\\chi\\vec{E}$$",
			"x": -180,
			"y": 190,
			"width": 290,
			"height": 250
		},
		{
			"id": "n-summary",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## 电介质公式汇总\n\n极化 → 电位移 → 高斯定理 → 边界条件 → 电容器",
			"x": 42,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 535,
			"height": 140
		},
		{
			"id": "n-d",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**电位移矢量**\n\n$$\\vec{D} = \\varepsilon_0\\vec{E} + \\vec{P}$$\n\n$$\\vec{D} = \\varepsilon\\vec{E}$$\n\n$$\\varepsilon = \\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon_r$$",
			"x": 380,
			"y": 220,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 220
		}
	],
